{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":139198,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910887\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Rubyy\" I don't know if they have spray tanning but I agree with @\"ashhtayy\" about it rubbing off. I would definitely recommend upgrading to airbrush for your make up. It was pretty hot on our wedding day and I didn't sweat it off at all. Like @\"sassylouxx\" we used an outside photographer as well and paid the outside vendor fee. The fee was expensive but definitely worth it - we absolutely loved our photographers!! We used Photos in Cancun - they were amazing! They were actually guests at our wedding we got along so well. We got the smaller package and invited them to join us for the dinner and reception.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n@\"KBrown\" I didn't use the DJs (we made our own playlist and just rented the sound equipment) but I know several brides have and loved them!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1455539962,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139114,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910854\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Rubyy\" No, definitely not ready but not in a panic - there's still time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Most of the big things are out of the way at this point but need to set aside sometime to work on the little tedious things. \n\nI am absolutely carrying my dress on - no way I'd put it in a suitcase. I would also be so scared it would get lost. I want to know exactly where it is at all times lol\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455450914,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139113,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that sassylouxx mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910853\n\n----------------------------------\nYes @\"Rubyy\" we have chosen Shenko Photography. Their work looks amazing, however they aren't an approved photographer so there will be an $800 fee to pay for them to come into the hotel on your wedding day. To be honest, I don't care because their pictures look so amazing and they reply to emails really fast (I'm in London, England). I can't wait to meet them I feel like I know them already. \n\nCheck them out! \n\nhttps:\/\/www.facebook.com\/shenkophotography\/ (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/shenkophotography\/)\n\n\nSarah\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":285443,"Name":"sassylouxx","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455450872,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139109,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910850\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Rubyy\" I agree 100% with @\"snswedding2016\"! That's actually what we are doing. We have 50+ people and it was just too expensive to go with one of the packages so we added what we needed and are bringing most of our decor. You can literally add anything you want from one of the MM packages individually - I like that you can customize it as much as you'd like.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455449680,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139102,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"Rubyy,\n\nsnswedding2016 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"wedding\".\n\nsnswedding2016 said:\n======================================================================\nI just responded in the Azul Fives Brides 2016 thread. I tried to reply to this last night but your message disappeared from my inbox for some reason. \n \nI would definitely go with the basic package and add on the decor you like from there. We used the Always and Forever package. We kept our ceremony pretty simple and brought some of our own decor. I only got flowers from lomas for the ceremony. Most of the decor we brought was for our reception in the garden. \n \nLet me know if you have any other questions!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=12814&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1455445696,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":12814},{"Id":139101,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that snswedding2016 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910848\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Rubyy\" I would go with the basic Always and Forever package and just add on from there. You can always add on the elements of the pure glamour package that you love separately without having to have everything that the package includes. You could also pick and choose from different packages (ex. chandelier from pure glamour and chair covers from vintage elegance). It allows you to have more flexibility and will definitely be cheaper for you especially if you're only using it for the ceremony. \n \nHappy planning!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1455445461,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139087,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that sassylouxx mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910843\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Rubyy\" your welcome <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm bringing my own. Only having centrepieces and chair bows for the reception. I'm keeping the ceremony very simple xx\n\n\nSarah\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":285443,"Name":"sassylouxx","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455439991,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139082,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that sassylouxx mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79615-azul-fives-by-karisma-brides-2016\/?view=findpost&p=1910841\n\n----------------------------------\nHi @\"Rubyy\" xx first off congrats! \n\nI feel like if u don't mind spending that much for only 10 guests then that's fine for you but personally I wouldn't be splashing out on that much when you can save so much more money and u can have your own input and ideas on your decor xx\n\n\nSarah\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":285443,"Name":"sassylouxx","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455438826,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139071,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that ashhtayy mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79940-newbie-getting-married-716-at-azul-fives\/?view=findpost&p=1910838\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Rubyy\" Congrats and welcome to the site! I'm a June 2016 AF bride. There are three forums for AF where you will find lots of information from past brides. Type Azul Fives in the search bar and you'll find everything you need <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455401896,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":139039,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"Rubyy,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome Rubyy to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello Rubyy,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=12809#msg22423\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1455375909,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":12809}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"10","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
